{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-234567890123",
    "name": "Baby Go — Auth",
    "description": "Auth local + social — contrato front.\n\n**Base:** {{baseUrl}} = http://localhost:3000/api → rutas `/v1/auth/...`\n**Headers:** `x-api-token: {{apiToken}}` en TODOS los requests (lo agrega el pre-request de la collection). Bearer {{token}} solo en GET/DELETE account y logout. El resto es público (auth: noauth).\n\n**Rate limit:** create account, resend-email-code, login, password-recovery, resend-password-recovery, new-password → 5/min. access-refresh → 10/min. Resto → 30/min global. Excedido → 429.\n\n**Create account** `{ name, lastName, email, password }` — NO mandar `role`.\n**Login** `{ email, password }` → `{ accessToken, refreshToken, expiresAt, user }`.\n**Refresh** → `{ token, refreshToken, expiresAt }` (access en `token`).\n\nErrores: `email_already_registered`, `invalid_credentials`, `email_not_verified`, `invalid_code`, `code_expired`, `account_not_found`, `invalid_refresh_token`, `expired_refresh_token`, `refresh_token_reuse_detected`.\nNew password incrementa `tokenVersion`: todos los access tokens previos dan 401 `Token has been revoked`.\n\nVariables: apiToken, token, refreshToken, accountId. Login/refresh guardan tokens en collection + environment.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// ApiTokenGuard global: todas las rutas (incluso las públicas) exigen x-api-token.",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'x-api-token', value: pm.variables.get('apiToken') || '' });"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "accountId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Local",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Create account (provider)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Pepe\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Perez\",\n  \"email\": \"pepe@gmail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Secret123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/account",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "account"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Público. Rate limit 5/min. Body: `{ name, lastName, email, password }` (password ≥ 8).\nNO enviar `role` (el API lo rechaza: whitelist).\nRespuesta `{ id, name, lastName, email, emailVerified:false }`. Guardá `id` → accountId.\nErrores: `email_already_registered`."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"accountId\", json.id);",
                  "    if (pm.environment) pm.environment.set(\"accountId\", json.id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "1b. Create account (client)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Ana\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Lopez\",\n  \"email\": \"ana@gmail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Secret123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/account",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "account"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Mismo contrato que create provider. No hay campo `role` en el BE; el tipo de usuario lo define el flujo (store vs cliente)."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"accountId\", json.id);",
                  "    if (pm.environment) pm.environment.set(\"accountId\", json.id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Email verification",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"accountId\": \"{{accountId}}\",\n  \"code\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/email-verification",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "email-verification"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Público. `{ accountId, code }` (código 6 dígitos, 10 min). `{ success: true }`.\nErrores: `account_not_found`, `invalid_code`, `code_expired`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2b. Resend email code",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"accountId\": \"{{accountId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/resend-email-code",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "resend-email-code"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Público. Rate limit 5/min. `{ accountId }` → `{ ok: true }`. Reenvía el código por email. Error: `account_not_found`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Login",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"pepe@gmail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Secret123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Público. Rate limit 5/min. `{ email, password }` → `{ accessToken, refreshToken, expiresAt, user: { id, email, name, lastName, picture, provider, emailVerified } }`.\nEl test guarda token y refreshToken.\nErrores: `invalid_credentials`, `email_not_verified`."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", json.accessToken);",
                  "    if (pm.environment) pm.environment.set(\"token\", json.accessToken);",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (json.refreshToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refreshToken\", json.refreshToken);",
                  "    if (pm.environment) pm.environment.set(\"refreshToken\", json.refreshToken);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3b. Get account (JWT)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/account",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "account"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Bearer. Perfil del usuario del token."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Access refresh",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/access-refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "access-refresh"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Público. Rate limit 10/min. `{ refreshToken }` → `{ token, refreshToken, expiresAt }` (ojo: acá el access viene en `token`, no `accessToken`). Rota el refresh anterior. El test actualiza ambas variables.\nErrores 401: `invalid_refresh_token`, `expired_refresh_token`, `refresh_token_reuse_detected` (se presentó un refresh ya rotado → se revocan TODAS las sesiones del usuario; volver a loguear)."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const access = json.token || json.accessToken;",
                  "  if (access) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", access);",
                  "    if (pm.environment) pm.environment.set(\"token\", access);",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (json.refreshToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refreshToken\", json.refreshToken);",
                  "    if (pm.environment) pm.environment.set(\"refreshToken\", json.refreshToken);",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Bearer + body `{ refreshToken }` → `{ ok: true }`. Invalida ese refresh."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "6. Password recovery",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"pepe@gmail.com\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/password-recovery",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "password-recovery"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Público. Rate limit 5/min. `{ email }` → `{ ok: true }`. Envía código al mail (10 min). Siempre 200 para no filtrar si el email existe."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "6b. Resend password recovery",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"pepe@gmail.com\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/resend-password-recovery",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "resend-password-recovery"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Público. Rate limit 5/min. `{ email }` → `{ ok: true }`. Igual que password-recovery."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "7. New password",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"pepe@gmail.com\",\n  \"recoveryCode\": \"123456\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"NewSecret123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/new-password",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "new-password"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Público. Rate limit 5/min. `{ email, recoveryCode, newPassword }` (password ≥ 8) → `{ ok: true }`. NO enviar `confirmPassword`.\nRevoca todos los refresh tokens e invalida los access tokens emitidos (401 `Token has been revoked`): hay que volver a loguear.\nErrores: `invalid_code`, `code_expired`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "8. Delete account (JWT)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/account",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "account"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Bearer. Borra usuario, refresh tokens y stores asociadas → `{ ok: true, deleted: { user, refreshTokens, stores } }`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "8b. Delete account by email (solo tests)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"pepe@gmail.com\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/account/delete-test",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "account",
                "delete-test"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Público, solo si NODE_ENV !== production (si no → `not_available_in_production`). `{ email }` → `{ ok: true, deleted: {...} }`. No usar en la app."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
